  messages:
  - Grab the remote and press action button  to start the simulation.
  - "An MRI device is a medical scanner that uses strong magnets and radio waves
    to create detailed images of the inside of your body. It\u2019s especially good
    for showing soft tissues like the brain, muscles, and organs\u2014without using
    any radiation."
  - Now press the remote controller button to turn the device ON.
  - Now press the remote controller button to turn the device ON.
  - The device is now available for use. Press the remote to call a patient
  - Please wait until the patient lies on the MRI bed
